{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0033-search-in-rotated-sorted-array","title":"LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0033-search-in-rotated-sorted-array","wordCount":847,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-33-搜索旋转排序数组\">LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>整数数组 <code>nums</code> 按升序排列，数组中的值<strong>互不相同</strong>。</p>\n<p>在传递给函数之前，<code>nums</code> 在预先未知的某个下标 <code>k</code>（<code>0 &lt;= k &lt; nums.length</code>）上进行了<strong>旋转</strong>，使数组变为 <code>[nums[k], nums[k+1], ..., nums[n-1], nums[0], nums[1], ..., nums[k-1]]</code>。例如，<code>[0,1,2,4,5,6,7]</code> 在下标 3 处旋转后变为 <code>[4,5,6,7,0,1,2]</code>。</p>\n<p>给你旋转后的数组 <code>nums</code> 和一个整数 <code>target</code>，如果 <code>nums</code> 中存在这个目标值，则返回它的下标，否则返回 <code>-1</code>。</p>\n<p>你必须设计一个时间复杂度为 <code>O(log n)</code> 的算法解决此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 5000</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>nums</code> 中的每个值都独一无二</li>\n<li><code>nums</code> 是一个可能经过旋转的升序排列数组</li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= target &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], target = 0&#10;输出：4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], target = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：4</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], target = 3&#10;输出：-1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2], target = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：-1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1], target = 0&#10;输出：-1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1], target = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：-1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题是二分查找的经典变体。普通二分查找要求数组完全有序，而旋转排序数组只是「部分有序」。如何在部分有序的数组中应用二分查找，是本题的核心挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"旋转数组的性质\">旋转数组的性质</h3><p>旋转排序数组有一个关键性质：将数组从中间分开，至少有一半是有序的。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[left] &lt;= nums[mid]</code>，则左半部分 <code>[left, mid]</code> 是有序的</li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[mid] &lt;= nums[right]</code>，则右半部分 <code>[mid, right]</code> 是有序的</li>\n</ul>\n<p>利用这个性质，可以判断 target 是否在有序的那一半中：如果在，就在那一半中继续二分；如果不在，就去另一半。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二分查找的决策逻辑\">二分查找的决策逻辑</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>左半有序</th>\n<th>右半有序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>target 在有序半区</td>\n<td><code>nums[left] &lt;= target &lt; nums[mid]</code></td>\n<td><code>nums[mid] &lt; target &lt;= nums[right]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作（在有序半区）</td>\n<td><code>right = mid - 1</code></td>\n<td><code>left = mid + 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作（不在有序半区）</td>\n<td><code>left = mid + 1</code></td>\n<td><code>right = mid - 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么每次都能排除一半\">为什么每次都能排除一半</h3><p>关键在于：有序半区的范围是确定的，我们可以精确判断 target 是否在其中。如果 target 在有序半区，正常二分；如果不在，target 一定在另一半（可能无序的那一半），继续递归即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function search(nums: number[], target: number): number {&#10;  let left = 0;&#10;  let right = nums.length - 1;&#10;&#10;  while (left &lt;= right) {&#10;    const mid = left + Math.floor((right - left) / 2);&#10;&#10;    if (nums[mid] === target) {&#10;      return mid;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (nums[left] &lt;= nums[mid]) {&#10;      if (nums[left] &lt;= target &amp;&amp; target &lt; nums[mid]) {&#10;        right = mid - 1;&#10;      } else {&#10;        left = mid + 1;&#10;      }&#10;    } else {&#10;      if (nums[mid] &lt; target &amp;&amp; target &lt;= nums[right]) {&#10;        left = mid + 1;&#10;      } else {&#10;        right = mid - 1;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return -1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> right) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> left) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[mid]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[left] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[mid]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[right]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2]</code>、<code>target = 0</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>mid</th>\n<th>nums[mid]</th>\n<th>有序半区</th>\n<th>target 位置</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>左 [4,5,6,7]</td>\n<td>0 不在左半</td>\n<td>left=4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>右 [1,2]</td>\n<td>0 不在右半</td>\n<td>right=4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>找到</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>返回 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三步就找到了目标，充分体现了 O(log n) 的效率。</p>\n<p>以 <code>nums = [4, 5, 6, 7, 0, 1, 2]</code>、<code>target = 3</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>left</th>\n<th>right</th>\n<th>mid</th>\n<th>nums[mid]</th>\n<th>有序半区</th>\n<th>target 位置</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>左 [4,5,6,7]</td>\n<td>3 不在左半</td>\n<td>left=4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>右 [1,2]</td>\n<td>3 不在右半</td>\n<td>right=4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>0≠3</td>\n<td>left=5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>left&gt;right</td>\n<td>返回 -1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"边界情况\">边界情况</h3><p>需要特别注意 <code>nums[left] &lt;= nums[mid]</code> 中的等号。当 <code>left === mid</code> 时（只有两个元素），<code>nums[left] === nums[mid]</code>，此时左半区只有一个元素，应该视为「左半有序」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>每次排除一半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>只使用常数变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 每一步都将搜索范围缩小一半，因此最多需要 O(log n) 步。这满足了题目的 O(log n) 要求。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 只使用 <code>left</code>、<code>right</code>、<code>mid</code> 三个变量，空间为 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>与相关题目的对比：</strong> LC #81（搜索旋转排序数组 II）允许重复元素，此时当 <code>nums[left] === nums[mid]</code> 时无法确定哪半部分有序，需要 <code>left++</code> 逐步缩小范围，最坏时间退化为 O(n)。LC #153（寻找旋转排序数组中的最小值）不需要搜索特定值，而是找旋转点，也是二分查找的变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 33 搜索旋转排序数组","id":"leetcode-33-搜索旋转排序数组"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"旋转数组的性质","id":"旋转数组的性质"},{"level":3,"text":"二分查找的决策逻辑","id":"二分查找的决策逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么每次都能排除一半","id":"为什么每次都能排除一半"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"边界情况","id":"边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 31 下一个排列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0031-next-permutation"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 34 在排序数组中查找元素的第一个和最后一个位置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-array-techniques/lc0034-find-first-and-last-position"}}